%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 609984c0f9ea9c94bb267b2f044e0140, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainSubtitles
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entries:
  - id: chemistry_lab_entrance
    note: "Kimya lab\u0131na ilk giri\u015F"
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Evet buras\u0131 da G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn \xFCzere kimya labarotuvar\u0131"
      textEN: Welcome to the Chemistry Lab...
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: "Evet biliyorum biraz s\u0131k\u0131c\u0131 ama ramo gay"
      textEN: Try not to touch anything you can't afford, which is everything.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: 
      textEN: ' And this monstrosity? It''s the Mass... Spectro... Spectro-ma-thingy...'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: whatever the hell they call it. It analyzes matter. You analyze the
        machine.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: 
      textEN: Just make it work. Don't bore me with the details.
      textDE: 
  - id: start_game
    note: "Kimya lab\u0131na ilk giri\u015F"
    segments:
    - duration: 5
      textTR: 
      textEN: "Professor... I see you\u2019re enjoying American tax-payer funded
        sleep."
      textDE: 
    - duration: 1
      textTR: 
      textEN: Wake up.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: 
      textEN: There is a notepad on your desk with the test sequence. Pick it up.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: 
      textEN: Let's see if you can handle simple instructions before we let you play
        with the big toys.
      textDE: 
  - id: pressure_emergency
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Doktor! Bas\u0131n\xE7 g\xF6stergelerine bak!"
      textEN: 
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: "Sistemi dengelemezsen aylar s\xFCren eme\u011Fimiz havaya u\xE7acak!"
      textEN: 
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2.5
      textTR: "Vanalar\u0131 \xE7evir! \u015E\u0130MD\u0130!"
      textEN: 
      textDE: 
  - id: particle_room_entrance
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: "Olum kilitli la i\u015Fte"
      textEN: 
      textDE: 
  - id: first_notepad
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: 
      textEN: 'Now, write that code into the Siswan Machine.

'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: And Professor? Do it exactly as written.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 1
      textTR: 
      textEN: No improvising.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 2
      textTR: 
      textEN: No creative liberties.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: You are here to follow orders, not to think freely.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 6
      textTR: 
      textEN: 'We cured you of that habit when we brought you here. Move.

'
      textDE: 
  - id: first_mistake
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: Is this a joke? IS IT?!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: I was told your people were perfectionists!
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: 
      textEN: ' ''Master Race,'' my ass... Right now, you can''t even type a few
        numbers correctly.

'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: ' Do I need to translate it into German for you, Jerry?'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: 
      textEN: DO IT AGAIN!
      textDE: 
  - id: tutorial_solved
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 3
      textTR: 
      textEN: See? Not that hard when you focus.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 3
      textTR: 
      textEN: I'm unlocking the lab doors. Get out there.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 7
      textTR: 
      textEN: 'Don''t expect a medal for doing what you''re told. Get back to work.

'
      textDE: 
  - id: final_code
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: Gute Arbeit. The math is done, Johan.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: 
      textEN: But equations don't win wars. Fire does.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 10
      textTR: 
      textEN: Proceed to the Test Chamber. What you do in the next five minutes will
        decide the fate of mankind for the next five hundred years.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 8
      textTR: 
      textEN: We are done playing with numbers... Go inside, and set the world on
        fire.
      textDE: 
  - id: new_dialogue_9
    note: 
    segments:
    - duration: 4
      textTR: 
      textEN: 'The pressure is spiking! What are you doing down there?!

'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 5
      textTR: 
      textEN: 'The pressure is spiking! What are you doing down there?!

'
      textDE: 
    - duration: 10
      textTR: 
      textEN: Proceed to the Test Chamber. What you do in the next five minutes will
        decide the fate of mankind for the next five hundred years.
      textDE: 
    - duration: 8
      textTR: 
      textEN: We are done playing with numbers... Go inside, and set the world on
        fire.
      textDE: 
